<title>CANADA: TABLE-FOREIGNERS SELL CANADA SECURITIES IN MAY.</title>
<headline>TABLE-FOREIGNERS SELL CANADA SECURITIES IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign investors sold a net C$3.47 billion in Canadian securities in May, after buying a net C$3.96 billion in April (revised from C$4.18 billion), Statistics Canada said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Canadian residents sold a net C$745 million of foreign securities after buying C$225 million in April (revised from C$291 million).</p>
<p>Foreign investments in Canadian securities (blns of dollars):</p>
<p>				  May	Apr	Year to date</p>
<p>    Total		   -3.473   +3.962    +4.001</p>
<p>    Bonds		   -1.765   +5.898    +4.646</p>
